It's my experience that All pets are afraid of monsters that are
much bigger than they are.  My first pet usually doesn't even
try biting acid blobs for awhile, until it's level 2 or 3 or so.
Similarly, they'll stay away from other monsters that are of higher
level than they are.

As a result, you probably will never see a pet of any kind consider
fighting a named demon.  You'll just have to leave all the summoned
minions to your pet and tackle Asmodeus yourself.

>I have a ring of conflict and used it once.  FiFi even turned on
>me!  What's up doc?

Like it sounds, a ring of conflict makes everything fight each other.
Everyone in sight has an urge to kill something, usually whatever is
nearest.  That include pets turning on their masters.  It also includes
pets turning on demons and shopkeepers, etc., which could toast your pet.

